 "open_gaps": [
  "No retained zizmor negative control shows it rejecting over-broad workflow permissions. The unsafe fixture declares contents: read, and the tests assert only template-injection and unpinned-uses. The scoped-permissions axis rests on configuration and source review (docs/catalog-provenance.md lines 2",
  "The hosted 0/1/0 attestation qualification is for run 35541322881 at d0fe136c (2026-09-20). On 2026-09-22, publish-catalog.yml added a tag trigger, a changed job condition, a Syft SBOM step and a second attest step (catalogs/foundation/automation.json@92bb279 scheduled_report_only_lanes[source=.gith",
  "The hosted sbom-vuln job in supply-chain.yml has no recorded run ID. Syft's native inventory evidence comes from a local run on one host against one SDK prefix, not whole-host or whole-runtime coverage.",
  "The Syft install checked checksums only. Signature and build provenance were not verified (blueprints/us-equities/supply-chain/README.md lines 51-52).",
  "Dependabot's weekly timing and nonempty minor/patch grouping are unobserved. Python and binary pins have no automated updater; the report-only catalog-freshness drift table stands in for one."
 ],
